.TH pepe-flow 1  pepe "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pepe\-flow \- Run a sequence of requests from a flow file, each step fed by the last
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpepe flow\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a sequence of requests from a flow file, each step fed by the last
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
The flow: a TOML file of [[step]]s (see the README)
